# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout across every platform, so tooling
# (Biome, the test fixtures, the build) sees the same bytes on Windows as it
# does on macOS and Linux. Without this, actions/checkout converts text files
# to CRLF on windows-latest and `biome check` fails on the line endings alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Image assets are binary and must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
